B.Uc=s(["Anyway, that's the vibe. Catch you on the board.","Alright, consider yourself briefed.","That's my two gems on it.","Go clear something beautiful.","Class dismissed, have fun out there.","Later, champ. Come back anytime.","You're all set. Lumen, out.","Now go be great. I'll be here glowing.","That's a wrap on that one.","Keep it cool, keep it rolling.","Off you go, hero.","Ping me if you get stuck again."],t.s)
